  "hero_summary_zh": "远古冰魄可以在整片战场的任意位置降下毁灭性的冰暴，衰弱的敌人一旦中招，无论身处何地都将粉身碎骨。减速敌人的同时他还能提升盟友在战场上的出手效果，对于他的敌人而言，他始终是一个威胁。",
  "hero_summary_en": "Able to launch a powerful blast of damaging ice across the battlefield, Ancient Apparition threatens to shatter weakened enemies wherever they are. Slowing enemies as he enhances his allies' effectiveness in battle, he is a constant threat to his foes.",
